            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuta yote ya mbuzi huyo atayaondoa kama aondoavyo mafuta ya wanyama wa sadaka za amani, naye kuhani atayateketeza madhabahuni, na harufu yake nzuri itampendeza Mwenyezi-Mungu. Basi, kuhani atamfanyia huyo mtu hiyo ibada ya upatanisho, naye atasamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
